 ### Edge Cases and Pitfalls
-- **Coherence Loss**: SIMD efficiency is tied to ray coherence. If some rays traverse a full cell while others pass through an empty one, coherence is lost [S1, S2, unofficial].
+- **Coherence Loss**: SIMD efficiency is tied to ray coherence. It is lost as soon as some rays traverse a full cell while others pass through an empty one [S1, unofficial][S2, unofficial].
